        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e18438c4-a4da-3f7b-b70c-63cd98583f24",
                "word": "ganja",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9d7a7463-31ca-4b40-b6e3-06f095677f1b",
                        "entry_id": "e18438c4-a4da-3f7b-b70c-63cd98583f24",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ganjas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2e9dec16-ee1c-3caa-9c43-88ec152a6e54",
                        "entry_id": "e18438c4-a4da-3f7b-b70c-63cd98583f24",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cannabis, préparation qui se fait avec les fleurs séchées du chanvre indien."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f62f5aad-2638-4c9f-8630-7dda46896535",
                                "sense_id": "2e9dec16-ee1c-3caa-9c43-88ec152a6e54",
                                "text": "Trois rastas sont allongés sous un cocotier, le visage planqué sous leurs dreadlocks. Ils ont visiblement fumé d’énormes joints de ganja et sont complètement défoncés."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "315c78cf-5f83-48a1-a0c8-be075fea5be2",
                                "sense_id": "2e9dec16-ee1c-3caa-9c43-88ec152a6e54",
                                "text": "Le tonton lui avait fait part de rumeurs concernant le cambriolage d’un appartement du quartier, propriété d’une styliste d’origine africaine. La styliste sortait avec un musicien. Ledit musicien avait une seconde vie de dealer de ganja."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d70e94ba-bf4d-465f-917a-a73250c2b4b5",
                                "sense_id": "2e9dec16-ee1c-3caa-9c43-88ec152a6e54",
                                "text": "– Plus de copines chez Edmond ?\n– Même pas le dimanche ?\n– Même pas le dimanche, elles fument toutes de la ganja… Tu vas pas résister. Sans parler de l’agricole au bois-bandé…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b3d659d-1e9d-4c0c-af06-48feb0c85884",
                                "sense_id": "2e9dec16-ee1c-3caa-9c43-88ec152a6e54",
                                "text": "C'est le Paradis de la défonce, ici ! Tu trouves tout ! Sub, coke, héro, shit, ganja ! Sans te parler de la pillave : des cadavres de Bushmill et de Smirnoff partout dans les faux plafonds !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9937e472-3d7a-49e9-a917-7625ad3a7216",
                                "sense_id": "2e9dec16-ee1c-3caa-9c43-88ec152a6e54",
                                "text": "Il y a aussi des SadhusVivekanandji et Umeshji qui devisent dans les vapeurs de ganja sur la foi et le monde tel qu'il va...."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d2c6912-88a3-4fe8-95b6-020ddcfbe7c2",
                        "source_entry_id": "e18438c4-a4da-3f7b-b70c-63cd98583f24",
                        "source_sense_id": "2e9dec16-ee1c-3caa-9c43-88ec152a6e54",
                        "target_lang_word": "ganja",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ganja",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d36abf3f-e609-35b8-9bd1-3e45aa310a10",
                                        "entry_id": "ee403d3e-46cd-3b88-b9c9-a820ffb42deb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marijuana, the inflorescence of the Cannabis sativa plant, smoked or ingested for euphoric effect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Caribbean",
                                            "India",
                                            "Singapore",
                                            "especially",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ad54f18-4055-4ded-9df2-53c7ffc71756",
                                                "sense_id": "d36abf3f-e609-35b8-9bd1-3e45aa310a10",
                                                "text": "Whilst a ganja-eater was catching fish on the bank of a river, a man from another country came and asked which was the road and what was his name; he replied that his name was \"eater of six maunds of ganja.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a47b85ee-5459-44f3-8dc2-88eec4f3091d",
                                                "sense_id": "d36abf3f-e609-35b8-9bd1-3e45aa310a10",
                                                "text": "There were altogether 2,202 admissions to the five asylums of this province during that time, and of that number it was ascertained that 641 were ganja smokers, 117 were spirit drinkers, and 8 were opium-eaters, the percentages being ganja 291 spririts 5'8, opium 036 per cent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c223d051-63d1-460e-a11b-c19221d20880",
                                                "sense_id": "d36abf3f-e609-35b8-9bd1-3e45aa310a10",
                                                "text": "In Bengal the natives talk of the ganja-bearing plant as the male and the weaker pollen-bearing plant as the female."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "725b3e57-a8e5-456d-8c7c-c1234d7af0d7",
                                                "sense_id": "d36abf3f-e609-35b8-9bd1-3e45aa310a10",
                                                "text": "It must be the ganja, it's the marijuana / That's creeping up on me, why I'm so high"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
